    "global_gap_units": 0.0625,
    "time_serialization_ulps": 16,
    "voltage_serialization_ulps": 8,
    "boundary_distance_s": 2.1e-12
  },
  "budget_basis": "Numerical quality target: one part per million of each fixed signal scale, with a 10 nV absolute floor; not ADC bit depth, LRM mandate, or backend tolerance. Inputs are checked 100 times more tightly to expose a faulty testbench. Event freedom is independent of numerical error.",
