      "source": "`include \"disciplines.vams\"\nmodule probe(u,y,count);\ninout u,y,count; electrical u,y,count;\nparameter real T=1e-6, TT=1e-10, Q0=0.125;\nreal q; integer n;\nanalog begin\n@(initial_step) begin q=Q0; n=0; end\n@(timer(T,T,TT)) begin q=V(u); n=n+1; end\nV(y)<+q; V(count)<+n;\nend\nendmodule\n",
